#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:172
msgid ""
"<p>Sets the maximum difference in seconds from a GPS track point to the "
"image time to be matched. If the time difference exceeds this setting, no "
"match will be attempted."
msgstr ""
"<p>Leggt den gröttsten tolaten Verscheel in Sekunnen twischen en GPS-"
"Spoorpunkt un de Bildtiet fast. Is de Tietverscheel grötter as disse Weert, "
"passt de twee nich tosamen."

#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:176
msgid "Time zone:"
msgstr "Tietrebeet:"

#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:222
msgid ""
"<p>Sets the time zone the camera was set to during photo shooting, so that "
"the time stamps of the images can be converted to GMT to match the GPS time "
"reference.\n"
"Note: positive offsets count eastwards from zero longitude (GMT), they are "
"'ahead of time'."
msgstr ""
"<p>Gifft dat Tietrebeet an, op dat de Kamera bi't Opnehmen vun't Bild "
"instellt weer. De Bild-Tietmarken laat sik denn op GMT ümreken un mit de GPS-"
"Tieden verglieken.\n"
"Beacht: Weerten grötter Null tellt na Oost vun de Null-Längde (GMT), se "
"loopt de GM-Tiet vörut."

#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:228
msgid "Interpolate"
msgstr "Estemeren"

#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:229
msgid ""
"<p>Set this option to interpolate GPS track points which are not closely "
"matched to the GPX data file."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn Du GPS-Spoorpünkt estemeren wullt, de beter to de Daten "
"ut de GPX-Datei passt."

#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:232
msgid "Difference in min.:"
msgstr "Verscheel in Minuten:"

#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:234
msgid ""
"<p>Sets the maximum time difference in minutes (240 max.) to interpolate GPX "
"file points to image time data."
msgstr ""
"<p>Leggt den gröttsten Tietverscheel för't Estemeren (toh. 240 Minuten) "
"twischen de GPX-Datenpünkt un de Bilddaten fast."

#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:267
